---
import Docs from "../layouts/Docs.astro";
---

<Docs
  title="Documentation"
  description="Learn how to run and control Lowland Linux machines in browsers and Node.js."
  current=""
  headings={[]}
>
  <article class="docs-home">
    <p class="eyebrow">Lowland documentation</p>
    <h1>Run Linux from JavaScript.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Lowland compiles Linux for wasm32. It boots a complete system in a browser or Node.js. Use
      the guest API to run processes, move files, attach devices, and connect machines.
    </p>

    <section class="first-step">
      <div>
        <h2>Start with a working machine</h2>
        <p>
          The tutorial starts with an empty page. It adds the required headers, boots a guest, and
          runs a command.
        </p>
        <a class="strong-link" href="/getting-started/">Run Linux in your browser →</a>
      </div>
      <pre><code>npm install @lowland/guest</code></pre>
    </section>

    <section class="next-steps">
      <h2>Go further</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="/attach-a-terminal/">Attach a terminal</a>
          <span>Connect a guest shell to xterm.js.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/reference/linux-guest/"><code>@lowland/guest</code></a>
          <span>Run processes, transfer files, and manage a prepared system.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/reference/kernel/"><code>@lowland/kernel</code></a>
          <span>Build a machine from memory, CPUs, and virtio devices.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>

</Docs>

<style>
  .eyebrow {
    margin-block: 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .docs-home h1 {
    max-width: 18ch;
    margin-block-start: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.75rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 60ch;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
  }

  .first-step {
    margin-block-start: 3.5rem;
    padding-block: 1.5rem;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .first-step h2,
  .next-steps h2 {
    margin-block-start: 0;
  }

  .first-step pre {
    margin: 0;
    align-self: center;
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    background: var(--surface);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .strong-link {
    color: var(--code-foreground);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .next-steps {
    margin-block-start: 3rem;
  }

  .next-steps ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    border-block-start: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }

  .next-steps li {
    margin: 0;
    padding-block: 0.7rem;
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem, 0.7fr) 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .next-steps li > :last-child {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  @media (min-width: 42rem) {
    .first-step {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 32rem) {
    .next-steps li {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
